    "description": "Initialize a Karpathy-style LLM wiki on Linux. Markdown knowledge base that LLMs read as context, scaffolded with Obsidian + Quartz. Use when the user is on Linux (Ubuntu/Debian/Fedora/Arch/etc.) and wants to set up a new personal/team wiki for LLM collaboration. For macOS see llm-wiki-init-macos; for Windows see llm-wiki-init-windows.",
